// ground's colour under the blade's feet), heightFraction (0 at the feet, 1 at the tip), random
// (a stable 0..1 per blade). Roots take the ground's colour so the field sits in its terrain; tips
// lift toward a lit spring green. No alpha is authored, so the blades draw as solid geometry.
